<h1>Job 1 Specification: bisCpsToMccaJob (CPS RFR Monthly Batch Job)</h1>
<h2>1. Executive Summary &amp; Job Overview</h2>
<table>
<tr>
<th>Attribute</th>
<th>Details</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Job Name / ID</b></td>
<td><code>bisCpsToMccaJob</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Source System</b></td>
<td><b>CPS</b> (Claim Payment System — Flat Files delivered via FTP / GCS Landing Zone)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Schedule / Frequency</b></td>
<td>Monthly (Runs on the 1st of the month at <code>12:45 AM</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Spring XML Configs</b></td>
<td><code>jobs/rfrBatchJob.xml</code> (<code>&lt;batch:job id=&quot;bisCpsToMccaJob&quot;&gt;</code>), <code>common/beanInfo.xml</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Input Flat Files</b></td>
<td>1. Header File (<code>${bis.cps.header.file.name}</code> — 19 semicolon-delimited columns)<br/>2. Detail File (<code>${bis.cps.detail.file.name}</code> — 66 semicolon-delimited columns containing <code>BIL*</code> and <code>CPT*</code> lines)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Staging / Temp Tables</b></td>
<td><code>MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR</code>, <code>MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code>, <code>MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Main Target Tables</b></td>
<td><code>MCCA_RFR</code>, <code>MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG</code>, <code>MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>External API Called</b></td>
<td><b>MCCA MMS REST API</b> — <code>POST /api/v1/Claim/Rfr</code> (Authenticated via ADFS OAuth2 <code>client_credentials</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><b>Email Notifications</b></td>
<td><code>cpsSuccessMail</code> (Step 9) or <code>cpsRejectMail</code> (if Step 5 <code>FileValidator</code> fails) via <code>MailImpl.java</code></td>
</tr>
</table>
<h2>2. End-to-End Architecture &amp; Step Execution Flow</h2>
<p><code>bisCpsToMccaJob</code> executes <b>10 sequential steps</b> (plus a conditional failure branch to <code>cpsRejectMailStep</code> if file cross-validation fails in Step 5):</p>
<pre>[Step 1: clearCpsTempTablesBeforeProcess]
       │ (Deletes all rows from MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR, MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG, MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT)
       ▼
[Step 2: rfrHeaderBisCpsToDbStep]
       │ (Reads CPS Header File -&gt; RfrHeaderFieldSetMapper -&gt; RfrHeaderBisToDbProcessor -&gt; Inserts into MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR)
       ▼
[Step 3: rfrDetailBisCpsToDbStep]
       │ (Reads CPS Detail File &apos;BIL*&apos; lines -&gt; RfrDetailFieldSetMapper -&gt; RfrDetailBisToDbProcessor -&gt; Inserts into MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG)
       ▼
[Step 4: rfrDetailCptBisCpsToDbStep]
       │ (Reads CPS Detail File &apos;CPT*&apos; lines -&gt; RfrDetailCptFieldSetMapper -&gt; RfrDetailCptBisToDbProcessor -&gt; Inserts into MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT)
       ▼
[Step 5: validateCpsFiles] (FileValidator.java)
       ├──► [Status = FAILED] ──► [cpsRejectMailStep] (Sends file failure email &amp; halts job)
       │
       ▼ [Status = COMPLETED]
[Step 6: rfrHeaderStep] (RfrHeaderProcessor.java)
       │ (Reads MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR + Paylogs + CPTs -&gt; Runs RFRValidator &amp; March 2022 Rules -&gt; Calls MMS API if valid -&gt; Inserts into MCCA_RFR)
       ▼
[Step 7: rfrDetailStep]
       │ (Copies all rows from MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG -&gt; MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG)
       ▼
[Step 8: rfrDetailCptStep]
       │ (Copies all rows from MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT -&gt; MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT)
       ▼
[Step 9: cpsSuccessMailStep] (MailImpl.java)
       │ (Sends completion email notification)
       ▼
[Step 10: clearCpsTempTables]
       │ (Cleans up MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR, MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG, MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT)</pre>
<h2>3. Input Flat File Layouts &amp; Mappers</h2>
<h3>3.1 CPS Header Flat File (rfrDelimitedLineTokenizer &amp; RfrHeaderFieldSetMapper.java)</h3>
<p>- <b>Delimiter</b>: Semicolon (<code>;</code>)</p>
<p>- <b>Lines to Skip</b>: <code>1</code> (Header row skipped)</p>
<p>- <b>Total Columns</b>: <code>19</code> (<code>includedFields</code>: <code>0</code> through <code>18</code>)</p>
<table>
<tr>
<th>Col Index</th>
<th>Tokenizer Field Name</th>
<th>Java Field (<code>RFR.java</code>)</th>
<th>Data Type</th>
<th>Mapping / Parsing Rule in <code>RfrHeaderFieldSetMapper</code></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>0</code></td>
<td><code>lineType</code></td>
<td><code>lineType</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>Trimmed string</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>1</code></td>
<td><code>carrierId</code></td>
<td><code>carrierId</code></td>
<td><code>long</code></td>
<td><code>readLong(&quot;carrierId&quot;)</code> (Default <code>0</code> if empty; must be <code>!= 0</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>2</code></td>
<td><code>carrierClaimNumber</code></td>
<td><code>carrierClaimNumber</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>Trimmed string (Mandatory; cannot be empty)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>3</code></td>
<td><code>mccaClaimNumber</code></td>
<td><code>mccaClaimNumber</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>Trimmed string</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>4</code></td>
<td><code>billSequenceNumber</code></td>
<td><code>billSequenceNumber</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>Trimmed string</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>5</code></td>
<td><code>insuredFirstName</code></td>
<td><code>insuredFirstName</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>Trimmed string</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>6</code></td>
<td><code>insuredMiddleInit</code></td>
<td><code>insuredMiddleInit</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>Trimmed string</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>7</code></td>
<td><code>insuredLastName</code></td>
<td><code>insuredLastName</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>Trimmed string</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>8</code></td>
<td><code>AdjusterFirstName</code></td>
<td><code>adjusterName</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>Concatenated with <code>AdjusterLastName</code>: <code>AdjusterFirstName + &quot; &quot; + AdjusterLastName</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>9</code></td>
<td><code>AdjusterLastName</code></td>
<td><code>adjusterName</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>Appended to <code>AdjusterFirstName</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>10</code></td>
<td><code>dateOfLoss</code></td>
<td><code>dateOfLoss</code></td>
<td><code>Date</code></td>
<td>Parsed using <code>yyyy-MM-dd</code> (<code>BatchConstants.RFR_DATE_FORMAT</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>11</code></td>
<td><code>claimantFirstName</code></td>
<td><code>claimantFirstName</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>Trimmed string</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>12</code></td>
<td><code>claimantMiddleInit</code></td>
<td><code>claimantMiddleInit</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>Trimmed string</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>13</code></td>
<td><code>claimantLastName</code></td>
<td><code>claimantLastName</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>Trimmed string</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>14</code></td>
<td><code>totalAmtBilled</code></td>
<td><code>totalAmtBilled</code></td>
<td><code>double</code></td>
<td><code>Double.valueOf()</code> (Defaults to <code>0.00</code> if empty)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>15</code></td>
<td><code>totalBillReviewFees</code></td>
<td><code>totalBillReviewFees</code></td>
