<h3>3.3 CPS Detail Flat File — CPT* Lines (rfrCptDelimitedLineTokenizer &amp; RfrDetailCptFieldSetMapper.java)</h3>
<p>- **Active Columns for <code>CPT*</code> Lines**: Columns <code>0, 5, 18, 39, 40, 41, 43..65</code> (<code>29</code> fields mapped when <code>lineType</code> starts with <code>&quot;CPT&quot;</code>, e.g., <code>&quot;CPTA&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;CPTB&quot;</code>).</p>
<table>
<tr>
<th>Col Index</th>
<th>Tokenizer Field Name</th>
<th>Java Field (<code>RfrDetailCpt.java</code>)</th>
<th>Data Type</th>
<th>Mapping / Parsing Rule</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>0</code></td>
<td><code>lineType</code></td>
<td><code>lineType</code> / <code>alphabetKey</code></td>
<td><code>String</code> / <code>char</code></td>
<td>Must start with <code>&quot;CPT&quot;</code>. <code>alphabetKey = lineType.charAt(3)</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>5</code></td>
<td><code>checkNumber</code></td>
<td><code>checkNumberKey</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>Used to build parent Paylog lookup key</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>18</code></td>
<td><code>uniqueKey</code></td>
<td><code>uniqueKey</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>Links to Header <code>UNIQUE_ID</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>39</code></td>
<td><code>eobId</code></td>
<td><code>eobId</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>EOB Identifier</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>40</code></td>
<td><code>billType</code></td>
<td><code>billType</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td><code>&quot;1500&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;UB04&quot;</code>, or <code>&quot;MISC&quot;</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>41</code></td>
<td><code>eobRevisionNum</code></td>
<td><code>eobRevisionNum</code></td>
<td><code>long</code></td>
<td><code>Long.valueOf()</code> (Default <code>0</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>43</code></td>
<td><code>serviceStartDate</code></td>
<td><code>serviceStartDate</code></td>
<td><code>Date</code></td>
<td>Parsed as <code>yyyy-MM-dd</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>44</code></td>
<td><code>serviceEndDate</code></td>
<td><code>serviceEndDate</code></td>
<td><code>Date</code></td>
<td>Parsed as <code>yyyy-MM-dd</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>45</code></td>
<td><code>serviceLocation</code></td>
<td><code>serviceLocation</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>Place of Service (required for <code>1500</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>46</code></td>
<td><code>cptCode</code></td>
<td><code>cptCode</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>CPT / HCPCS Procedure Code</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>47</code>–<code>50</code></td>
<td><code>Modifier1</code>–<code>Modifier4</code></td>
<td><code>modifier1</code>–<code>modifier4</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>CPT Modifiers 1 to 4</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>51</code></td>
<td><code>serviceUnits</code></td>
<td><code>serviceUnits</code></td>
<td><code>long</code></td>
<td><code>Long.valueOf()</code> (Default <code>0</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>52</code></td>
<td><code>totalCharges</code></td>
<td><code>totalCharges</code></td>
<td><code>double</code></td>
<td><code>Double.valueOf()</code> (Default <code>0.00</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>53</code></td>
<td><code>totalChargesCarrierApproved</code></td>
<td><code>totalChargesCarrierApproved</code></td>
<td><code>double</code></td>
<td><code>Double.valueOf()</code> (Default <code>0.00</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>54</code></td>
<td><code>revenueCode</code></td>
<td><code>revenueCode</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>Revenue Code (required for <code>UB04</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>55</code></td>
<td><code>prescriberNpi</code></td>
<td><code>prescriberNpi</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>Prescriber NPI</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>56</code>–<code>65</code></td>
<td><code>Icd1</code>–<code>Icd10</code></td>
<td><code>icd1</code>–<code>icd10</code></td>
<td><code>String</code></td>
<td>CPT-level ICD diagnosis codes 1 through 10</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h2>4. Detailed Step-by-Step Business Logic, Conditions &amp; SQL Queries</h2>
<h3>Step 1: clearCpsTempTablesBeforeProcess (DBUtils.java)</h3>
<p>Executes 3 <code>DELETE</code> statements to ensure a clean staging state before reading the CPS flat files:</p>
<pre>DELETE FROM MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT;
DELETE FROM MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG;
DELETE FROM MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR;</pre>
<h3>Step 2: rfrHeaderBisCpsToDbStep (RfrHeaderBisToDbProcessor.java &amp; RFRWriter.java)</h3>
<p>1. Sets <code>rfr.recordType = &quot;RFR&quot;</code> and <code>rfr.claimType = &quot;CPS&quot;</code>.</p>
<p>2. Runs <code>RFRValidator.validate(rfr)</code>:</p>
<p>- <b>Rule H1 (<code>isTotalBillAmountValid</code>)</b>: If <code>totalMccaPaymentReq &gt; (totalAmtBilled + totalBillReviewFees)</code> -&gt; <code>pendingStatus = true</code>, appends <code>&quot;totalAmtBilled,totalMccaPaymentReq&quot;</code>.</p>
<p>- <b>Rule H2 (<code>isCrossCompanionClaim</code>)</b>: If <code>crossCompanionClaimNumber</code> non-empty -&gt; <code>crossCompanionIndicator = &quot;Y&quot;</code>, <code>pendingStatus = true</code>, appends <code>&quot;crossCompanionClaimNumber&quot;</code>; else <code>&quot;N&quot;</code>.</p>
<p>- <b>Rule H3 (<code>isInitial</code>)</b>: If <code>billSequenceNumber</code> in <code>(&quot;001&quot;, &quot;1&quot;)</code> -&gt; <code>pendingStatus = true</code>, appends <code>&quot;billSequenceNumber&quot;</code>.</p>
<p>- Sets <code>statusIndicator = &quot;PN&quot;</code> if <code>pendingStatus</code> else <code>&quot;OK&quot;</code>.</p>
<p>3. Verifies <code>carrierId != 0</code> and <code>!carrierClaimNumber.isEmpty()</code>, caches <code>headerMap.put(uniqueKey, rfr)</code>, and inserts into <code>MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR</code>.</p>
<h3>Step 3: rfrDetailBisCpsToDbStep (RfrDetailBisToDbProcessor.java &amp; RFRPayLogWriter.java)</h3>
<p>1. Filters for <code>lineType.startsWith(&quot;BIL&quot;)</code>.</p>
<p>2. Verifies <code>headerMap.containsKey(uniqueKey)</code>, inherits <code>carrierClaimNumber</code> and <code>carrierId</code>, truncates <code>payeeOrProvider</code> to <code>50</code> characters, fetches <code>MCCA_PAYLOG_ID_SEQ.NEXTVAL</code> into <code>paylogUniqueId</code>, caches <code>paylogMap.put(uniqueKey-eobId-billType-eobRevisionNum-checkNumberKey-alphabetKey, paylogUniqueId)</code>, and inserts into <code>MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code>.</p>
<h3>Step 4: rfrDetailCptBisCpsToDbStep (RfrDetailCptBisToDbProcessor.java &amp; RFRPayLogCptWriter.java)</h3>
<p>1. Filters for <code>lineType.startsWith(&quot;CPT&quot;)</code>.</p>
<p>2. Verifies <code>headerMap.containsKey(uniqueKey)</code>, looks up <code>carrierPaylogId</code> from <code>paylogMap</code> using <code>uniqueKey-eobId-billType-eobRevisionNum-checkNumberKey-alphabetKey</code> (throws <code>UnexpectedInputException</code> if missing), and inserts into <code>MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code>.</p>
<h3>Step 5: validateCpsFiles (FileValidator.java)</h3>
<p>Cross-validates all 3 staging tables:</p>
<p>- Every Header <code>UNIQUE_ID</code> must exist in <code>MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code> and vice versa.</p>
<p>- Every CPT <code>CARRIER_PAYLOG_ID</code> must exist as a <code>PAYLOG_UNIQUE_ID</code> in <code>MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code>.</p>
<p>- On failure -&gt; routes to <code>cpsRejectMailStep</code> and halts job.</p>
<h3>Step 6: rfrHeaderStep (RfrHeaderProcessor.java, RFRValidator.java, RfrRestClient.java)</h3>
<p>Reads every header from <code>MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR</code>, loads its paylogs and CPT lines, runs all 12 validation rules (<code>isPreviousRfrSubmitted</code>, <code>RFRValidator.validate</code>, <code>isBillAmountValid</code>, <code>isCorrection</code>, <code>isBillTypeValid</code>, <code>isServiceFacilityZipValid</code>, <code>isCptRequired</code>, <code>isCptListValid</code>, <code>validateTINNPI</code>, <code>validateUBBillTypeField</code>, <code>validateCPTCodes</code>, <code>validateNonMandatoryCPTCodes</code>, <code>validateRevenueCodes</code>, <code>validatePayCodeBillType</code>).</p>
<p>- If <code>pendingStatus == false</code>, submits JSON payload to <code>POST /api/v1/Claim/Rfr</code> (<code>STATUS = &apos;SB&apos;</code> on HTTP 2xx, or <code>&apos;PN&apos;</code> + <code>SUBMIT_ERR_MSG</code> on error).</p>
<p>- Inserts header into <code>MCCA_RFR</code>.</p>
<h3>Step 7: rfrDetailStep</h3>
<p>Copies all rows from <code>MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code> into <code>MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG</code>.</p>
<h3>Step 8: rfrDetailCptStep</h3>
<p>Copies all rows from <code>MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code> into <code>MCCA_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code>.</p>
<h3>Step 9: cpsSuccessMailStep (MailImpl.java)</h3>
<p>Sends completion email notification.</p>
<h3>Step 10: clearCpsTempTables (DBUtils.java)</h3>
<p>Deletes all rows from <code>MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG_CPT</code>, <code>MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR_PAYLOG</code>, and <code>MCCA_CPS_TMP_RFR</code>.</p>
</body></html>
